  "description": "Woody Go Round is a merry-go-round with a round wooden platform and hand rails in Mango Yellow and Cherry Red. Children hold the rails, push off with their feet, then jump on and ride, taking turns to push. It suits 4 to 8 children at a time. The platform covers 5'9\" x 5'9\" and the safe play area is 8'9\" x 8'9\", which keeps a clear ring around the spinning edge. That small footprint lets you add it to a society play area or a school ground without redrawing the whole layout. The listed skills are self control and confidence building. Galvanised pipe and laminates on it are covered for 3 years, and the bearing for 1 year. Ask us for a quote with the spinning zone shown.",
